Output demo-dark.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 200
Set Padding 24
Set Theme {"background":"#0d1117","foreground":"#e6edf3","cursor":"#e6edf3"}
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "wally run qwen3 --hide-thinking 'Give me three short reasons to run a model locally, one line each.'"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
